{"cells": [{"cell_type": "markdown", "id": "424dc3eb", "metadata": {}, "source": ["# PCS Metrics (patent\u2192paper) \u2014 Validation & Visualization\n", "\n", "Face-validity checks for the PCS outputs (how often **US patents cite each paper**), rendered inline:\n", "coverage, citation distributions, windowed monotonicity, accrual by publication year (patent citations\n", "are slow), examiner vs non-examiner share, windowed-vs-total, and hit-percentile distribution.\n", "\n", "## Inputs\n", "```\n", "notebook/pcs/output/pcs_citation.parquet        # C_{3,5,10,all} + C_examiner/non_examiner_{w} + C_total(+split)\n", "notebook/pcs/output/pcs_hit_probability.parquet # FoS, year, pctl_{c3,c5,c10,call}\n", "```"]}, {"cell_type": "code", "execution_count": 1, "id": "8d356c4c", "metadata": {}, "outputs": [{"name": "stdout", "output_type": "stream", "text": ["[val] pcs_validation  ->  /project/jevans/Dawoon/Science of Science/validation/Figures/pcs_validation_<section>.{jpg,pdf}  @ 600 dpi\n", "  pcs_validation      OK\n"]}, {"data": {"text/plain": ["True"]}, "execution_count": 1, "metadata": {}, "output_type": "execute_result"}], "source": ["import os, sys\n", "import numpy as np, pandas as pd\n", "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n", "%matplotlib inline\n", "plt.rcParams['figure.dpi'] = 110; plt.rcParams['axes.grid'] = True; plt.rcParams['grid.alpha'] = 0.3\n", "sys.path.insert(0, '/project/jevans/Dawoon/Science of Science/validation')\n", "import val_common as V\n", "V.init('pcs_validation')\n", "POUT = V.PCS_OUT               # notebook/pcs/output -> Science of Science/pcs/output\n", "ROOT = V.BASE\n", "V.preflight()"]}, {"cell_type": "markdown", "id": "8bc541d1", "metadata": {}, "source": ["## 1. Load pcs_citation + pcs_hit (merge on paper_id)"]}, {"cell_type": "code", "execution_count": 2, "id": "f088d8e6", "metadata": {}, "outputs": [{"name": "stdout", "output_type": "stream", "text": ["rows: {'cit': 5106527, 'hit': 4480434, 'merged': 5106527}\n", "cols: ['paper_id', 'C_3', 'C_5', 'C_10', 'C_all', 'C_examiner_3', 'C_non_examiner_3', 'C_examiner_5', 'C_non_examiner_5', 'C_examiner_10', 'C_non_examiner_10', 'C_examiner_all', 'C_non_examiner_all', 'C_total', 'C_examiner_total', 'C_non_examiner_total', 'FoS', 'year', 'pctl_c3', 'pctl_c5', 'pctl_c10', 'pctl_call']\n", "CPU times: user 9.48 s, sys: 1.59 s, total: 11.1 s\n", "Wall time: 10.3 s\n"]}, {"data": {"text/html": ["<div>\n", "<style scoped>\n", "    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n", "        vertical-align: middle;\n", "    }\n", "\n", "    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n", "        vertical-align: top;\n", "    }\n", "\n", "    .dataframe thead th {\n", "        text-align: right;\n", "    }\n", "</style>\n", "<table border=\"1\" class=\"dataframe\">\n", "  <thead>\n", "    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n", "      <th></th>\n", "      <th>paper_id</th>\n", "      <th>C_3</th>\n", "      <th>C_5</th>\n", "      <th>C_10</th>\n", "      <th>C_all</th>\n", "      <th>C_examiner_3</th>\n", "      <th>C_non_examiner_3</th>\n", "      <th>C_examiner_5</th>\n", "      <th>C_non_examiner_5</th>\n", "      <th>C_examiner_10</th>\n", "      <th>...</th>\n", "      <th>C_non_examiner_all</th>\n", "      <th>C_total</th>\n", "      <th>C_examiner_total</th>\n", "      <th>C_non_examiner_total</th>\n", "      <th>FoS</th>\n", "      <th>year</th>\n", "      <th>pctl_c3</th>\n", "      <th>pctl_c5</th>\n", "      <th>pctl_c10</th>\n", "      <th>pctl_call</th>\n", "    </tr>\n", "  </thead>\n", "  <tbody>\n", "    <tr>\n", "      <th>0</th>\n", "      <td>W979</td>\n", "      <td>0</td>\n", "      <td>0</td>\n", "      <td>0</td>\n", "      <td>0</td>\n", "      <td>0</td>\n", "      <td>0</td>\n", "      <td>0</td>\n", "      <td>0</td>\n", "      <td>0</td>\n", "      <td>...</td>\n", "      <td>0</td>\n", "      <td>1</td>\n", "      <td>0</td>\n", "      <td>1</td>\n", "      <td>NaN</td>\n", "      <td>NaN</td>\n", "      <td>NaN</td>\n", "      <td>NaN</td>\n", "      <td>NaN